{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>כרע, התהלכתי</b> — joined with 'as a mourner.' And the correct reading: that it is עם קודר הלכתי ('I walked as one in mourning')." "And the meaning of קודר — for it is the custom of the mourner to clothe himself in dark garments."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 35, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:29:37.068048943Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}